Each Giant, Titan or Lord of Thunder stack calls down Lightning Bolt
after its first successful attack. Once per stack per battle; 10
damage per creature. No mana or manual activation is required.

Visit your own Tower town while wearing the relic to add 2 weekly
recruits to its Giants and Titans dwelling. That dwelling must be
built; lower-tier growth is unchanged.
Includes all eight artifacts. Extra copies give no further bonus.

